      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2025-june/q1",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z=2-2\\sqrt3i\\quad\\text{and}\\quad w=-1+\\sqrt3i\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>show that</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p><span data-math=\"\\left|\\dfrac zw\\right|=\\dfrac{|z|}{|w|}\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li><p><span data-math=\"\\arg(zw)=\\arg(z)+\\arg(w)\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
