      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2025-june/q4",
      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_1=a+bi\\quad\\text{and}\\quad z_2=c+di\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span data-math=\"a\"></span>, <span data-math=\"b\"></span>, <span data-math=\"c\"></span> and <span data-math=\"d\"></span> are real constants.</p><p>Given that</p><ul><li><span data-math=\"b&gt;d\"></span></li><li><span data-math=\"z_1+z_2\"></span> is real</li><li><span data-math=\"|z_1|=\\sqrt{13}\"></span></li><li><span data-math=\"|z_2|=5\"></span></li><li><span data-math=\"\\operatorname{Re}(z_2-z_1)=2\"></span></li></ul><p>show that <span data-math=\"a=2\"></span> and determine the value of each of <span data-math=\"b\"></span>, <span data-math=\"c\"></span> and <span data-math=\"d\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p>On the same Argand diagram</p><ul><li>sketch the locus of points <span data-math=\"z\"></span> which satisfy <span data-math=\"|z-12|=7\"></span></li><li>sketch the locus of points <span data-math=\"w\"></span> which satisfy <span data-math=\"|w-5i|=4\"></span></li></ul><p>showing the coordinates of any points of intersection with the axes.</p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li><p>Determine the range of possible values of <span data-math=\"|z-w|\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
